adr: 0301
file: selfhost/apfront.pas
kills: dump-symbols
why: --dump-symbols claims to report every name a source declares and reported no formal parameter at all until ADR-0301; nothing noticed, because an outline is not where a reader looks for one. A completion list inside a routine's body is, and without this walk the names most likely to be typed next are the ones missing. Removing it also empties `count`, `sink` and every parameter from lsp/sessions/completion.out.
--- old
    DumpSymParams(d^.pdParams, depth + 1);
--- new
    { mutated: parameters unreported }
